| --- | --- |
| `npm run dev` | API on `APP_PORT` ({{ ports.APP_PORT }}; restarts when `server/src` or `.env` change) + Vite with hot reload on `WEB_PORT` ({{ ports.WEB_PORT }}) |
| `npm run build` | Type-check, then build the web app into `web/dist` |
